[B]Blessed is the servant [C#]who stays faithful
Giving [D#m]food at the proper time, [A#]never hateful
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[D#m]So stay awake because the [C#]time is [D#m]near
Be ready for the moment [C#]that you [D#m]fear
[B]The Son of Man [F#]comes at an un[C#]expected [D#m]hour
